OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fevening and night with variable
OL,7,Famounts of cloud and some clear
OL,8,Fperiods. Chance of a brief light
OL,9,Fshower across Orkney. Slight frost in
OL,10,Fplaces.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FIt will be a dry day with
OL,13,Fsunny intervals. Moderate occasionally
OL,14,Ffresh east or northeasterly wind.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,17,Fand bright on Monday. Strengthening
OL,18,Fsoutheasterly winds may bring rain for
OL,19,Fa time later on Tuesday and Wednesday,
OL,20,Fotherwise dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
